    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Introducing My Class)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "When class starts at 9:00, our teacher checks our homework"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and our journals that we put on his desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When I don’t do my homework, I get so nervous"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and feel like I have butterflies in my stomach."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes I hide my hands under my desk"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "because I am afraid of what my teacher will say."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Like most other students, my favorite subject is P.E.,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and the class I dislike the most is history."
    },
